        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fresh take on spatial puzzles—<strong>Quadcubes</strong> challenges you to think in three dimensions. Every move matters as you manipulate falling shapes around the X, Y and Z axes to complete and clear layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace in <strong>Relax Mode</strong>, or test your reflexes in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, where cleared layers speed up the descent of new pieces. <br>Choose a 4×4, 5×5 or 6×6 playfield and tailor the difficulty to your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898080/extras/2539524645a9a8197b9bef84e1624797.avif?t=1756893301\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True 3D Rotation</strong> – Full freedom to spin and slide each block in all three axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes</strong> – Relax Mode for stress‑free play; Challenge Mode for escalating speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variable Playfields</strong> – Select 4×4, 5×5 or 6×6 grids to scale complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Design</strong> – Clean visuals keep the focus on puzzle‑solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Tracking</strong> – personal bests records to chase higher scores.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fresh take on spatial puzzles—<strong>Quadcubes</strong> challenges you to think in three dimensions. Every move matters as you manipulate falling shapes around the X, Y and Z axes to complete and clear layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play at your own pace in <strong>Relax Mode</strong>, or test your reflexes in <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, where cleared layers speed up the descent of new pieces. <br>Choose a 4×4, 5×5 or 6×6 playfield and tailor the difficulty to your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898080/extras/2539524645a9a8197b9bef84e1624797.avif?t=1756893301\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True 3D Rotation</strong> – Full freedom to spin and slide each block in all three axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes</strong> – Relax Mode for stress‑free play; Challenge Mode for escalating speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variable Playfields</strong> – Select 4×4, 5×5 or 6×6 grids to scale complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Design</strong> – Clean visuals keep the focus on puzzle‑solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Tracking</strong> – personal bests records to chase higher scores.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Quadcubes is a minimalist puzzle game where you move, rotate, and stack falling blocks across all three axes to fill and clear layers. Play at your own pace or take on an increasing challenge as the speed rises and try to reach the highest score you can.",
